<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-022-B habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.150128" lon="-120.841358"><name>SC26-022-B</name><cmt>SC26-022</cmt><desc>Avila rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 4.4 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 58/100; not catch probability. Center 180 ft; nearby 174–189 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Parallel bands visible in survey rendering; confirm small-scale relief by sonar. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9KBGELE"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-005</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.15839305141739" lon="-120.83724285768234"/><trkpt lat="35.15765847142787" lon="-120.83649390864859"/><trkpt lat="35.15702771821581" lon="-120.83651061617718"/><trkpt lat="35.15712762533758" lon="-120.83705682375754"/><trkpt lat="35.15739794824483" lon="-120.8370496652321"/><trkpt lat="35.157681986564675" lon="-120.83781054420403"/><trkpt lat="35.15795426855086" lon="-120.837913108086"/><trkpt lat="35.15797189480486" lon="-120.8389005891104"/><trkpt lat="35.1583323257338" lon="-120.838891052223"/><trkpt lat="35.158336241639184" lon="-120.8391104935336"/><trkpt lat="35.1578171251117" lon="-120.84033171734218"/><trkpt lat="35.15746451980091" lon="-120.84078012607405"/><trkpt lat="35.15683376478244" lon="-120.84079680039848"/><trkpt lat="3